&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;High performance in areas outside of professional work (E.g hobbies, side business, sport, creative)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Having taken on additional responsibility in a team environment (E.g coaching, mentoring, team projects)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
