&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission at HubSpot is to help millions of organizations grow better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Head of Performance Partnerships, you&#39;ll help shape how buyers discover, evaluate, and trust HubSpot in an AI-first internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role leads HubSpot&#39;s global affiliate, AEO/citation, nano/micro creator, and forum-growth ecosystem, driving efficient ARR growth while expanding HubSpot&#39;s visibility across emerging discovery channels including AI search, Reddit, nano/micro creators, review platforms, and third-party recommendation ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with Growth, Product, PMM, Brand, and Paid Media leaders to build scalable, experimentation-driven partnership strategies that connect discovery to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic, hands-on leadership role for someone excited about defining the future of performance marketing in the AI era.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead HubSpot&#39;s global Performance Partnerships strategy across affiliate marketing, AI-native discovery, nano/micro creator partnerships, forum growth, and emerging acquisition channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale affiliate and publisher ecosystems that drive efficient customer acquisition and ARR growth across key products and go-to-market motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-first partnership strategies that increase HubSpot visibility across LLMs, Reddit, review platforms, nano/micro creator ecosystems, and third-party recommendation surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and operationalize experimentation programs across affiliate models, nano/micro creator partnerships, indirect demand measurement, and emerging growth channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own partner investment strategy, commission frameworks, attribution models, and portfolio optimization across a multi-million-dollar investment portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a high-performing global team spanning affiliate partnerships, optimization, AI visibility initiatives, and forum growth programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Paid Media, Product, Product Marketing, Brand, Community, Finance, Analytics, and Growth teams to integrate partnership-led discovery into HubSpot&#39;s broader go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reporting frameworks and executive-ready narratives that connect partnership activity to ARR growth, demand generation, and AI visibility outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging discovery trends and translate ambiguous market signals into scalable growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data-driven decision-making while balancing experimentation, operational rigor, and long-term strategic impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in affiliate marketing, partnerships, growth marketing, performance marketing, or related go-to-market functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling affiliate or partner ecosystems tied to measurable revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of modern discovery behaviors, including AI search, Reddit, creators, review platforms, and emerging acquisition channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing significant marketing investments and optimizing toward revenue and efficiency metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and experimentation mindset with the ability to translate ambiguous signals into scalable growth programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional initiatives across Product, Marketing, Growth, Analytics, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing high-performing teams in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication, stakeholder management, and strategic storytelling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance strategic thinking with operational execution and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-enabled marketing workflows and evolving discovery ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AEO, SEO, AI visibility, or LLM citation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with creator partnerships, influencer ecosystems, or community-led growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with attribution, incrementality, or indirect demand measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in B2B SaaS and/or product-led growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling emerging acquisition programs from experimentation to operational maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
