&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HubSpot, we empower thousands of businesses around the world to grow better. If you thrive in solving complex challenges, love learning, and enjoy collaborating with a global team, this role could be your next great opportunity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is changing how businesses buy. Buyers arrive informed, and they want to see their own business running in HubSpot, with proof it will deliver results, before they commit. HubSpot&#39;s customer platform connects customer context, Breeze AI agents and a unified CRM, so growing businesses get real outcomes, not just new software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Solutions Engineer working with our Upmarket sales org (Midmarket/Corp), you&#39;ll partner with Account Executives to show mid-sized businesses what HubSpot can do for them, then prove it. You&#39;ll lead discovery, tell outcome-led stories through tailored demos, and build lightweight working proofs so customers can try their solution before they buy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pre-sales role, not a software engineering role. It suits people who enjoy business conversations as much as building with technology, and who want to grow their technical, customer, communication and sales skills fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you love storytelling and building, you thrive at the intersection of business and technology, and want to help write the playbook for how software is bought next, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work a varied pipeline of new and existing-customer deals alongside Account Executives, from discovery to the technical win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery to understand each customer&#39;s goals, pain points, current systems and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tell compelling, outcome-led stories (via demos and product led experiences) that show customers how their business can be reimagined in HubSpot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives to map the technical buying committee, competitive landscape and path to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design HubSpot solutions that fit the customer&#39;s processes and connect sensibly with the tools they already use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lightweight proofs of concept with AI tools, Breeze AI agents and HubSpot configuration, scoped to clear use cases and success criteria, and help customers try them hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answer ad-hoc or RFP-based technical, security and integration questions, collaborating with specialists and partners as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help your AE shape the business case and value story for the customer&#39;s first use cases. Prove the outcome via use-case roadmap and a consumption plan that sizes the first commitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep what you show realistic to deploy, and hand over clear context to solution architects, onboarding teams and partners so customers start strong and realise value fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example: mentor other SEs, run initiatives, share field feedback and reusable assets with the team to improve our playbooks and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel occasionally to customer sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer-facing technical or consultative role for a SaaS product, such as solutions engineering, technical consulting, implementation, onboarding or customer success with a track record of winning complex deals or delivering solutions that moved business results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Humility and a growth mindset: the world of SaaS is changing fast and there is a lot of ambiguity. Nobody can know everything. You’re happy to lead from the front where needed and offer your support to team mates while equally being open to learn from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Art-of-the-Possible Storytelling: Ability to turn a customer&#39;s goals into a compelling, outcome-led vision of their business reimagined in HubSpot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills &amp;amp; stakeholder management - both internal and external: you feel equally comfortable talking to IT as to C-suite, you can tell a story about business outcomes that resonates with stakeholders at various levels and you can successfully navigate multiple internal &amp;amp; external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity in discovery: you ask good questions, dig deep into business, financial and individual pain, and pick up on needs customers don&#39;t explicitly share.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of how SaaS platforms connect, including APIs, integrations and data migration and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building with AI tools, either professionally or in a personal project, and a demonstrable habit of learning as tools evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a complex, multi-stakeholder pipeline independently, surfacing technical, commercial and timing risks before they land&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with HubSpot or a similar CRM platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects you&#39;ve built, deployed or hosted yourself, for example a portfolio you can walk us through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with business cases, ROI conversations or consumption-based pricing (seats and credits).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting customers in their own environments after the sale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have several roles open at different levels within this team within our Mid-Market and Corp segments. During the process, if we believe your experience may align more closely with another level/segment, we’ll discuss this with you and outline potential next steps.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot offers a flexible, supportive environment designed to help you do your best work and grow your career:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary, commissions and stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first flexibility - work from home, the office, or hybrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured onboarding and ongoing learning opportunities (including an annual education allowance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Time Off policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare and wellness reimbursements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary and Secondary Caregiver Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups and inclusion programs to support belonging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering time so you can give back to your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently recognised as a great place to work by&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.comparably.com/companies/hubspot/reviews&quot;&gt; Comparably.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out HubSpot’s&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers?hubs_signup-cta=careers-nav-homepage&quot;&gt; careers&lt;/a&gt; site to see all our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/benefits&quot;&gt; benefits&lt;/a&gt; and learn more about our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot’s culture is driven by a shared passion for our mission and metrics. It’s a culture of amazing, growth-minded people who solve for the customer, embrace boldness and adaptability, and thrive on alignment and collaboration. &lt;em&gt;We know the confidence gap and impostor syndrome can get in the way of meeting spectacular candidates, so please don’t hesitate to apply - we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
