&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Partner Specialist, you will be responsible for identifying, sourcing, closing, and activating good-fit partners.&lt;/strong&gt; Using strong consultative selling skills, you will balance contacting warm inbound leads with sourcing your own pipeline, then partner closely with new partners through their first 12 months to ensure they become productive, revenue-generating members of the HubSpot ecosystem.&lt;br&gt;In this role you are responsible for selling the value of HubSpot’s agentic customer platform and the Partner Program. During the sales and activation process, you will guide partners as they learn how HubSpot can help them deliver stronger go-to-market results for their clients, including agentic-built marketing campaigns, agentic-first data augmentation and prospecting, and agentic-first customer support solutions. You’ll help partners improve client acquisition and retention rates and grow their own profitability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you’ll get to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a large pipeline of leads and opportunities through a combination of outbound and inbound strategies to identify, recruit, and develop prospective high-value partners through a defined reseller acquisition process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dissect a partner’s business goals and help them build a better plan for achieving them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert at presenting how HubSpot’s agentic customer platform can help partners and their clients improve go-to-market results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close new business at or above quota level by identifying partners who are willing to invest both time and money in leveraging our software and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activate new partners during their first 12 months by enabling them to sell and implement HubSpot software to their clients, and drive them to meet defined sales thresholds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach partners on how to position, sell, and implement agentic marketing, data and prospecting, and customer support solutions for their own client base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with marketing, technology, and partner enablement teams to execute sales and activation strategy as the company introduces enhancements to existing solutions and releases new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring your thinking, strategies, and ideas to advance our company’s values, unique culture, and vision for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for people who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the desire and commitment to do what it takes to be successful in sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a positive outlook and a strong ability to take responsibility for their successes and failures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have exceptional consultative selling and closing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are top producers in their current role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a sharp focus on their goals and a belief that their daily, weekly, and monthly activities will help achieve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about AI and agentic technology, and energized by helping partners adopt it to change how their clients go to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy coaching and enabling others to drive long-term, measurable partner success after the initial close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
