&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Solutions Architect&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission at HubSpot is to help millions of organizations grow better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Solutions Architect, you&#39;ll help our strategic customers solve complex business challenges and unlock more value from HubSpot&#39;s unified, AI-powered customer platform. You&#39;ll combine technical expertise with business insight to design scalable solutions, guide integrations, and help customers build technology strategies that support long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with Customer Success, Solutions Partners, Product, and Engineering teams to connect customer needs with practical, high-impact solutions. You&#39;ll also help customers explore how emerging technologies, including AI, can improve their operations and customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a collaborative team focused on helping HubSpot&#39;s most technically complex customers succeed. Together, you&#39;ll turn challenging business requirements into scalable solutions, support customer adoption, and share technical expertise that strengthens how we serve customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to strategic customers, translating complex business requirements into scalable solutions across HubSpot&#39;s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and guide complex CRM integrations, platform consolidation initiatives, and multi-hub solutions that improve efficiency and support customer business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop technical recommendations and roadmaps that help customers prioritize investments, increase platform adoption, and achieve measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead technical discovery and solution design for complex customer engagements, applying best practices across HubSpot&#39;s CRM, APIs, automation capabilities, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with customers and Solutions Partners to evaluate technical requirements, identify implementation risks, and recommend practical solutions that support long-term success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore AI-powered solutions and emerging technologies, identifying opportunities to improve customer workflows, automate processes, and deliver measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and present technical proofs of concept, including AI-powered automations, that demonstrate potential solutions and help stakeholders make informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with Customer Success, Product, and Engineering teams to share customer insights, identify recurring technical challenges, and recommend improvements to HubSpot&#39;s platform and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in solutions architecture, technical consulting, or a related customer-facing technical role, with demonstrated success designing and delivering complex SaaS solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of CRM architecture, system integrations, APIs, data flows, and technical design principles, including the ability to develop scalable and maintainable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience analyzing ambiguous business and technical challenges, evaluating solution options, and translating requirements into clear technical recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to connect technical solutions to business outcomes, including operational efficiency, platform adoption, and return on investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing solutions that connect multiple systems, business processes, and stakeholders across an organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, including the ability to explain complex technical concepts to technical and nontechnical audiences and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience collaborating across teams and managing technical risks, priorities, and stakeholder expectations throughout complex customer engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of AI technologies, automation, and their practical applications in business processes, with the ability to evaluate opportunities and limitations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with HubSpot&#39;s CRM platform, including advanced configuration, custom objects, workflows, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience advising enterprise or strategic customers on technology adoption, digital transformation, or long-term technical planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience developing AI-powered automations, proofs of concept, or solutions using AI APIs and orchestration tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience collaborating with technology partners, systems integrators, or consulting organizations to deliver complex customer solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience developing reusable technical guidance, sharing best practices, or mentoring colleagues on solution architecture approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Sofia, Bulgaria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work arrangement:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
